---
layout: base.njk
title: "Contact | Afrique Amitié"
description: "Contactez l'association Afrique Amitié pour toute demande administrative ou archive historique."
activeNav: ""
---

<article class="pt-32 pb-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">

  <div class="mb-16">
    <span class="font-label uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary font-semibold text-xs mb-4 block">Continuité administrative</span>
    <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl text-primary font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
      Contactez-nous
    </h1>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
      Bien que l'association Afrique Amitié ait cessé ses activités opérationnelles en 2026, nous maintenons une veille pour toute demande administrative ou archive historique.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-start">

    <!-- Formulaire -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10">

      <!-- Message succès -->
      <div id="msg-success" class="hidden mb-8 flex items-start gap-3 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-fixed rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings:'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
        Votre message a bien été envoyé. Nous vous répondrons dans les meilleurs délais.
      </div>

      <!-- Message erreur -->
      <div id="msg-error" class="hidden mb-8 flex items-start gap-3 bg-error-container text-on-error-container rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">error</span>
        Une erreur est survenue. Merci de réessayer ou de nous contacter directement par email.
      </div>

      <form id="contact-form" method="POST" action="/contact/">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6">
          <div>
            <label class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-2 block" for="nom">Nom complet</label>
            <input type="text" id="nom" name="nom" placeholder="Jean Dupont" required
              class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded px-4 py-3 text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/40 border border-outline-variant/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-primary transition-colors text-sm"/>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-2 block" for="email">Adresse email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="jean.dupont@exemple.com" required
              class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded px-4 py-3 text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/40 border border-outline-variant/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-primary transition-colors text-sm"/>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-6">
          <label class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-2 block" for="objet">Objet</label>
          <input type="text" id="objet" name="objet" placeholder="Ex. : demande d'archives, témoignage…" required
            class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded px-4 py-3 text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/40 border border-outline-variant/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-primary transition-colors text-sm"/>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-6">
          <label class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-2 block" for="message">Votre message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Comment pouvons-nous vous aider ?" rows="6" required
            class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded px-4 py-3 text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/40 border border-outline-variant/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-primary transition-colors text-sm resize-none"></textarea>
        </div>

        <!-- Cloudflare Turnstile -->
        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAADPOvqSVr_WvpRfy" data-theme="light"></div>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" id="submit-btn"
          class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-3 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
          Envoyer le message
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-8">

      <!-- Carte statut -->
      <div class="bg-secondary-container rounded-xl p-6">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-3xl mb-3 block" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">info</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-lg font-bold text-on-secondary-fixed mb-2">Statut de l'association</h2>
        <p class="text-on-secondary-fixed/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Conformément à la clôture de nos activités, les délais de réponse peuvent être plus longs. Nous traitons les demandes par ordre de priorité administrative.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Siège historique -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-surface-container rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">location_on</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-1 block">Siège historique</span>
          <p class="font-bold text-on-surface">Villenave d'Ornon, France</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</article>

<!-- Turnstile script -->
<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>

<!-- Gestion des retours (succès / erreur) -->
<script>
  (function () {
    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    if (params.get('sent') === '1') {
      document.getElementById('msg-success').classList.remove('hidden');
      document.getElementById('contact-form').classList.add('hidden');
    } else if (params.get('error')) {
      document.getElementById('msg-error').classList.remove('hidden');
    }
  })();
</script>
